{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Spring XD framework is based on Spring Boot and uses a modular architecture with Maven/Gradle build system",
    "The HDFS sink module uses Hadoop's FileSystem API for file operations",
    "Kafka source module is based on Spring Kafka library",
    "Custom modules will be packaged as ZIP files containing JAR files and metadata",
    "PHD 3.0 certification requires compatibility testing with Pivotal HD distribution components",
    "All UI changes will be made using Spring XD's admin UI built with Spring Boot and JavaScript",
    "Partition configuration will be implemented as extension points in the stream processing DSL"
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Developer has access to Spring XD source code and development environment",
    "No additional team members are involved in this increment",
    "Developer is familiar with Spring XD architecture and module system",
    "PHD 3.0 environment is available for certification testing",
    "Estimated effort includes time for code reviews and basic testing",
    "No major architectural changes are required for the new features",
    "Developer will work full-time on this increment",
    "Time for deployment, configuration, and initial setup of PHD 3.0 environment is included in U8 estimates"
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "U1_DEBUG",
      "activity_name": "Investigate and Fix Job Creation Error",
      "activity_description": "Debug the job creation error from admin UI with ROLE_CREATE and ROLE_ADMIN, trace through UI component, REST API, and controller layers to identify root cause (likely authorization or request parameter issue) and implement fix. Includes adding proper error logging.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U2_PARTITION_CONFIG",
      "activity_name": "Implement Explicit Partition Count Configuration",
      "activity_description": "Add configuration option for explicit partition count in stream definitions, modify partitioning logic in stream processing module, update stream definition parser, and add corresponding test cases. Includes documentation updates.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U3_KAFKA_DYNAMIC",
      "activity_name": "Implement Dynamic Partition Subscription for Kafka Source",
      "activity_description": "Extend Kafka source module to support dynamic partition subscription, modify consumer configuration to accept dynamic partition list, implement partition assignment strategy, and add test cases for dynamic partition scenarios.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U4_HDFS_SYNCABLE",
      "activity_name": "Implement Syncable Writes Option for HDFS Sink",
      "activity_description": "Add configuration option for Syncable writes in HDFS sink module, implement Hadoop Syncable API integration, modify file writing logic to support fsync operations, add performance trade-off configuration, and include unit tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U5_HDFS_FILENAME",
      "activity_name": "Implement Direct Filename Writing for HDFS Sink",
      "activity_description": "Add configuration option to bypass temporary file suffix (.tmp) in HDFS sink, modify file creation logic to write directly to specified filename, ensure compatibility with Syncable writes option, and add test cases.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U6_CUSTOM_MODULE_UPLOAD",
      "activity_name": "Implement Maven/Gradle Upload Targets for Custom Modules",
      "activity_description": "Create Maven plugin and Gradle task for uploading custom modules to Spring XD runtime, implement REST client for module deployment API, handle module dependencies and validation, add integration tests for upload workflow.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U7_MODULE_VERSIONING",
      "activity_name": "Implement Custom Module Versioning",
      "activity_description": "Design and implement versioning scheme for custom modules, modify module metadata to include version information, implement version conflict resolution, add upgrade/downgrade capabilities, create version management UI or CLI tools, and add comprehensive tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "U8_PHD_CERTIFICATION",
      "activity_name": "Certify Spring XD Against PHD 3.0",
      "activity_description": "Set up PHD 3.0 test environment, configure Spring XD cluster with PHD components, execute compatibility test suite, identify and fix any compatibility issues, document certification results and known limitations. Includes environment setup time.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 25.5
  }
}
```

